{
  "info": {
    "name": "PNC Education System API",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for testing the PNC Education System API.\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n\n### 1. Set Environment Variables\nCreate a Postman environment with these variables:\n- `base_url`: `http://localhost:8000/api` (your API base URL)\n- `access_token`: (will be auto-set after login)\n- `refresh_token`: (will be auto-set after login)\n- `student_id`: (set after creating a student)\n- `user_id`: (set after creating a user)\n- `role_id`: (set after creating a role)\n- `import_log_id`: (set after uploading an import)\n- `selection_batch_id`: (set after creating a batch)\n\n### 2. Auto Token via Tests\nAfter calling **Login**, the test scripts automatically save tokens to the collection variables.\n\n### 3. Run in Order\nStart with Login → then any authenticated endpoints.\n\n---\n\n**Base URL:** `{{base_url}}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "pnc-api-tester"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentication",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints - login, logout, refresh token, etc.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', jsonData.refresh_token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved!');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate and get JWT token + refresh token.\n\n**Rate limit:** 5 requests per minute\n**Response includes:** access_token, refresh_token, user info, and permissions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get authenticated user's profile and permissions."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Invalidate current JWT token and revoke all refresh tokens."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Exchange a refresh token for a new access token."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', jsonData.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@test.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/password/reset",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "auth", "password", "reset"]
            },
            "description": "Request a password reset link (sent via email).\n\n**Rate limit:** 3 requests per minute"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n    \"reset_token\": \"your-reset-token-here\",\n    \"password\": \"newpassword123\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"newpassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/password/reset/confirm",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "auth", "password", "reset", "confirm"]
            },
            "description": "Confirm password reset with token received via email.\n\n**Rate limit:** 3 requests per minute"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
